    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/Crease19NEWS/status/2083703849122951401",
      "text": "UPDATE: IDAHO SHOOTER IS DEAD... NO MORE THREAT TO THE PUBLIC..  SAFE TO COME OUT...\n#IDAHO #SHOOTING",
